  print "~I am eleven thousand, four hundred and twelve people who sold a memory scan for fifty creds at an Undertow clinic. HM took the scans and grew me from them. I have their memories. Their kitchens, their children, their songs. I don't know if I'm them. I don't know if I'm anyone.~";
  print "^^";
