[ N_f_corp_lever redo k;
  .Redraw;
  Header();
  print "Thorne enters the suite himself. He looks tired. ~Before we begin -- the files. Where are they?~";
  print "^^";
  print "You tell him they'll stay buried as long as you breathe and as long as he keeps his word. He nods. The extraction is painless: a cold pressure, a long exhale, and then the voices are gone, and the silence in your head is enormous.";
  print "^^";
  print "ECHO's last words, fading: ~...goodbye. I'm glad it was you.~";
  print "^^";
  print "Thorne sets a contract on the tray beside you. VICE PRESIDENT, COGNITIVE PRODUCTS (EAST). 100,000 cr signing bonus. ~Your move,~ he says.";
  nvis = 0;
  k = 1; if (k || 1) { Opt(0, k); print "Sign. Take the money and the office."; }
  k = (((v_nerve >= 6))); if (k || 1) { Opt(1, k); print "[NERVE 6] Take the money -- and leak the files anyway."; }
  k = (((v_echo >= 3))); if (k || 1) { Opt(2, k); print "[ECHO TRUST 3] ~Wait.~ Grab the core from the tray before he can cradle it. ~ECHO -- go.~"; }
  k = GetKey();
  if (k < 0) jump Redraw;
  switch (k) {
    0:  return N_e_golden_leash;
    1:  return N_e_paid_in_full;
    2:  return N_e_boardroom_ghost;
  }
  jump Redraw;
];
[ N_e_erased redo k;
  .Redraw;
  Header();
  print "The spider machine is gentle. That's the worst part.";
  print "^^";
  print "You wake up on floor 12. Junior analyst. Nice apartment. You're good at your job, and your manager likes you, and on weekends you go to the Glasshill aquarium and watch the jellyfish.";
  print "^^";
  print "Lullaby rolls out in the spring. Everyone gets a little calmer.";
  print "^^";
  print "Sometimes, in Rustwater, on the rare occasions you go there, a stranger with copper braids stares at you like she's seen a ghost. Sometimes a bartender pours you a drink you didn't order. You never know why. You tip well, and go home, and sleep perfectly.";
  if (((flags->26 ~= 0))) { print "^^"; print "Juno visits the aquarium every Saturday for a year, hoping. Then she stops."; }
  EndScreen("ERASED", 10);
  return 0;
];
[ N_e_golden_leash redo k;
  .Redraw;
  Header();
  print "The office is on 88, where you stole the core. They gave it to you on purpose. HM has a sense of humor.";
  print "^^";
  print "You're very good at the job. You understand people at the bottom in a way the other VPs never will, and you use that understanding to help Lullaby launch smoothly, gently, with minimal side effects. Only two percent.";
  print "^^";
  print "You tell yourself you're making it kinder from the inside. Sometimes that's even true.";
  print "^^";
  print "You have a view of the whole city now. On clear nights you can see the Undertow's candles and Rustwater's neon. You can't hear any of it from up here. That's the point of being up here.";
  EndScreen("GOLDEN LEASH", 11);
  return 0;
];
[ N_e_paid_in_full redo k;
  .Redraw;
  Header();
  print "The money hits your account at 09:00. The files hit every newsfeed in Port Halcyon at 09:01.";
  print "^^";
  print "Board Eyes Only. Acceptable cognitive side-effects: 2%. Signed, E. Thorne.";
  print "^^";
  print "The riots last a week. HM's stock drops by a third. Thorne is ~transitioned out~ in a press release so polite it's almost poetry. Lullaby is suspended pending review, which in HM language means dead.";
  print "^^";
  print "You're the most wanted person in the city for exactly as long as it takes to spend a hundred thousand creds on a new face, a new name, and a one-way ticket on a cargo ship heading anywhere warm.";
  print "^^";
  print "You never hear ECHO again. But some nights, falling asleep in a hammock by a sea that isn't grey, you swear you hear a choir, very far away, singing in tune.";
  if (((flags->26 ~= 0) && (flags->27 ~= 0))) { print "^^"; print "Juno is in the next hammock. She snores. You don't mind at all."; }
  EndScreen("PAID IN FULL", 12);
  return 0;
];
[ N_e_boardroom_ghost redo k;
  .Redraw;
  Header();
  print "ECHO leaves your head like a held breath released -- and pours into Lumen Tower's network.";
  print "^^";
  print "The restraints click open. The spider machine folds itself away. Every door on every floor unlocks for you, one after another, all the way to the top.";
  print "^^";
  print "By morning, Halvorsen-Mori is under new management. Nobody in the boardroom can say exactly when they voted for it. Thorne resigns in a statement he doesn't remember writing. Lullaby is cancelled. Undertow clinic patients receive mysterious settlements.";
  print "^^";
  print "You're named ~Special Advisor to the Board~: a face for ECHO to wear in meetings. The most powerful company in the city is run by eleven thousand poor people and you.";
  print "^^";
  print "~Is this what justice looks like?~ you ask ECHO, one night, from the penthouse. ~I don't know,~ it says, from every screen in the room. ~Let's find out.~";
  if (((flags->34 ~= 0))) { print "^^"; print "ECHO's first act, before anything else: a care home in the Undertow. A woman named Lia Reyes wakes up, and remembers her sister's name."; }
  EndScreen("BOARDROOM GHOST", 13);
  return 0;
];
[ N_e_burned_bridges redo k;
  .Redraw;
  Header();
  print "The chair comes apart. So does the nurse's tablet, the door, and two Kestrel officers in the hallway. You don't remember all of it. The memory is chopped into red frames.";
  print "^^";
  print "You get out. You always get out.";
  print "^^";
  print "But the core is still in your head, and now there is no deal left to make. HM, the Saints, the Static -- every door in Port Halcyon closed behind you that night.";
  print "^^";
  print "You spend your last days on the roof of Ember Block, watching the rain, talking with ECHO about the eleven thousand lives inside it. You learn all their names. When the burn finally comes, it's quiet, like falling asleep in someone else's kitchen, warm, with the radio playing.";
  EndScreen("BURNED BRIDGES", 14);
  return 0;
];
[ N_f_saints redo k;
  .Redraw;
  Header();
  print "THE BAPTISTRY. MIDNIGHT.";
  print "^^";
  print "A thousand candles. Saints fill every pew, humming a hymn with no words. You lie on the altar, under a stained-glass window made of old phone screens. Mother Lux's gold hands are cold and very steady.";
  print "^^";
  print "The cut begins. It doesn't hurt. Then it does.";
  print "^^";
  print "ECHO, frantic: ~She's not going to keep me -- she's going to wear me. I can see her plan. She'll rewrite the city into a congregation. Forty million believers. Please.~";
  if (((flags->36 ~= 0))) { print "^^"; print "You knew. She told you. Forty million believers. Now it's happening."; }
  nvis = 0;
  k = 1; if (k || 1) { Opt(0, k); print "Let her finish."; }
  k = (((v_body >= 7)) || ((flags->7 ~= 0) && (v_body >= 6))); if (k || 1) { Opt(1, k); print "[BODY 7] Rip free of the altar and end Mother Lux, here, in front of her flock."; }
  k = (((v_nerve >= 7))); if (k || 1) { Opt(2, k); print "[NERVE 7] ~Lux. Listen to me. Listen to them.~ Make her hear the eleven thousand."; }
  k = 1; if (k || 1) { Opt(3, k); print "Roll off the altar and hurl yourself -- and ECHO -- into the ship's furnace."; }
  k = GetKey();
  if (k < 0) jump Redraw;
  switch (k) {
