  print "^^";
  print "Null's tank glows. ~Plug in. We'll push everything you're carrying into the Lattice. Forty million ports at once. The uplink will burn hot. Stay with it as long as you can.~";
  print "^^";
  print "You hold the cable. ECHO is very quiet.";
  print "^^";
  print "~Wherever this goes,~ ECHO says, ~thank you for asking me what I am.~";
